Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.19 101/191] i2c: aspeed: fix invalid clock parameters for very large divisors
Date:   Sat,  9 Nov 2019 21:38:43 -0500
Message-Id: <20191110024013.29782-101-sashal@kernel.org>
